                "text": "Federal programs can be life-changing for families like the Dealys. Trevor was deemed unemployable by the Department of Vocational Rehabilitation, but through utilizing Medicaid programs and services, he has started an in-home business creating artisanal soaps. I\u2019m proud to fight for Medicaid programs so that Americans like Trevor can access the care they need to thrive.",
