                "text": "My Prevent Government Shutdowns Act would bring Democrats and Republicans together to guarantee essential federal services for working families. In the meantime, Speaker Johnson, Leader Thune, and President Trump must come to the negotiating table to protect healthcare, restore SNAP, and lower costs for working families in CA-19 and across the country.",
