                "source": "Buffer",
                "text": "Monday, December 8, from 11:30AM to 3:30 PM, I will be holding office hours in South San Jose.\nThis is your opportunity to share your thoughts on issues, ask questions, or seek assistance with federal agencies like Social Security, Medicare, or Veterans Affairs. \nPlease note, we anticipate a high number of submissions, so we may not be able to fulfill all requests. Submitting a meeting request through the online form does not guarantee that you will have an appointment. \nIf we are able to offer you a meeting, you will be contacted by staff to schedule a time. Appointments are available on a first-come, first-served basis.  \nRequest a meeting during office hours here: https://t.co/0Xs7YwBjL7",
